#: ../../data-import.rst:2
msgid "Importing data"
msgstr "导入数据"

#: ../../data-import.rst:4
msgid ""
"Orbit reads the common genomics formats directly. Drag a file onto the "
"window, or press the **Import** button in the toolbar. The format is "
"chosen by extension."
msgstr "Orbit 直接读取常见的基因组格式。把文件拖进窗口，或点工具栏的  导入  。格式按扩展名判断。"

#: ../../data-import.rst:9
msgid "Supported formats"
msgstr "支持的格式"

#: ../../data-import.rst:15
msgid "Format"
msgstr "格式"

#: ../../data-import.rst:16
msgid "Extension"
msgstr "扩展名"

#: ../../data-import.rst:17
msgid "Notes"
msgstr "说明"

#: ../../data-import.rst:18 ../../data-import.rst:35
msgid "bigWig"
msgstr "bigWig"

#: ../../data-import.rst:19
msgid "``.bw`` ``.bigWig``"
msgstr "``.bw`` ``.bigWig``"

#: ../../data-import.rst:20
msgid "Random access, no indexing step. Best choice for signal."
msgstr "随机访问，无需建索引。信号轨道的首选。"

#: ../../data-import.rst:21 ../../data-import.rst:57
msgid "bedGraph"
msgstr "bedGraph"

#: ../../data-import.rst:22
msgid "``.bedGraph`` ``.bdg``"
msgstr "``.bedGraph`` ``.bdg``"

#: ../../data-import.rst:23
msgid "Loaded into memory; fine up to a few hundred MB."
msgstr "整份读进内存；几百 MB 以内没问题。"

#: ../../data-import.rst:24 ../../data-import.rst:77
msgid "BAM"
msgstr "BAM"

#: ../../data-import.rst:25
msgid "``.bam``"
msgstr "``.bam``"

#: ../../data-import.rst:26
msgid "BAM is scanned into an in-memory index during import; .bai is not used."
msgstr "导入时会扫描 BAM 并建立内存索引；不会使用 .bai。"

#: ../../data-import.rst:27 ../../data-import.rst:102
msgid "GTF / GFF3"
msgstr "GTF / GFF3"

#: ../../data-import.rst:28
msgid "``.gtf`` ``.gff`` ``.gff3``"
msgstr "``.gtf`` ``.gff`` ``.gff3``"

#: ../../data-import.rst:29
msgid "Becomes a gene track; UTR and CDS features are kept."
msgstr "变成一个基因轨道；UTR 和 CDS 特征都会保留。"

#: ../../data-import.rst:30 ../../data-import.rst:135
msgid "FASTA"
msgstr "FASTA"

#: ../../data-import.rst:31
msgid "``.fa`` ``.fasta``"
msgstr "``.fa`` ``.fasta``"

#: ../../data-import.rst:32
msgid "Adds an independent sequence track for matching genomic coordinates."
msgstr "为匹配的基因组坐标添加独立的序列轨道。"

#: ../../data-import.rst:37
msgid ""
"The recommended format. Orbit parses the index itself, so there is no "
"``bigWigToBedGraph`` step and no conversion. Multi-sample overlays work "
"best when the files share a coordinate system."
msgstr "推荐格式。Orbit 自己解析索引，不需要 ``bigWigToBedGraph`` 转换。多样本叠加时，文件之间共用坐标系效果最好。"

#: ../../data-import.rst:45
msgid ""
"The track appears immediately with autoscale on. Open its label to pin "
"the range if you want several samples to share one scale."
msgstr "轨道会立刻出现，默认自动缩放。想让多个样本共用同一量程，就打开轨道标签把范围固定下来。"

#: ../../data-import.rst:52
msgid ""
"A local ``.bw`` signal track imported onto hg38. The signal is added to "
"the signal panel with autoscale on, and its label (``Scr_R1_IP``) appears"
" in the left sidebar. Its filename alone does not establish the "
"experimental assay."
msgstr ""
"导入到 hg38 的本地 ``.bw`` 信号轨道。信号会加入信号面板并自动缩放，左侧栏显示其标签（ ``Scr_R1_IP`` "
"）。仅凭文件名不能确定实验类型。"

#: ../../data-import.rst:59
msgid ""
"Plain text, four columns (``chrom  start  end  value``). Convenient for "
"small, hand-made tracks; a genome-wide file will cost memory, so prefer "
"bigWig above a few hundred megabytes. Orbit renders bedGraph exactly like"
" bigWig — same signal panel, same autoscale, same colour controls."
msgstr ""
"纯文本，四列（ ``chrom  start  end  value`` ）。适合小型手工轨道；全基因组级别会吃内存，超过几百 MB 建议改用 "
"bigWig。Orbit 渲染 bedGraph 与 bigWig 完全一致——同一信号面板、同样的自动缩放与配色控件。"

#: ../../data-import.rst:72
msgid ""
"A four-column ``.bedGraph`` file on hg38, rendered identically to a "
"bigWig signal track. Both go through the same drawing path, so you can "
"mix ``.bw`` and ``.bedGraph`` in one view."
msgstr ""
"hg38 上的四列 ``.bedGraph`` 文件，渲染效果与 bigWig 信号轨道完全一致。两者走同一条绘制路径，因此可以在同一视图里混用 "
"``.bw`` 与 ``.bedGraph`` 。"

#: ../../data-import.rst:79
msgid ""
"Orbit scans the BAM during import and builds an in-memory interval index;"
" ``.bai`` is not required or consumed by this implementation. Initial "
"import costs time and memory. The current loader caps accepted reads at "
"6,000,000; check the truncation notice for larger files. Coverage and "
"displayed reads are then queried for the visible window, and dense "
"alignments may be sampled."
msgstr ""
"Orbit 会在导入时扫描 BAM 并建立内存区间索引；当前实现不要求也不会使用 ``.bai`` 。初始导入会消耗时间和内存。当前加载器最多接受"
" 6,000,000 条 reads；对于更大的文件，请查看截断提示。随后会查询可见窗口中的覆盖度和显示 reads，高密度比对可能会抽样。"

#: ../../data-import.rst:89
msgid ""
"The sidebar has a parent signal switch and a subordinate alignment "
"switch: turn the parent on to see coverage, then enable the alignment "
"switch for reads. Turning the parent off hides both; reads are not "
"independent of the parent."
msgstr ""
"侧栏有一个父级信号开关和一个从属的比对开关：打开父级开关可查看覆盖度，再启用比对开关查看 reads。关闭父级开关会同时隐藏两者；reads "
"不能脱离父级单独显示。"

#: ../../data-import.rst:97
msgid ""
"A BAM imported onto hg38, shown at ``chr1:11.79–11.81 Mb``. The blue "
"track is read coverage; the striped block below it is the stacked "
"alignments. The bundled RefSeq track (``MTHFR``, ``CLCN6``) sits above "
"for context."
msgstr ""
"导入到 hg38 的 BAM，显示在 ``chr1:11.79–11.81 Mb`` 。蓝色轨道是 reads "
"覆盖度；其下方的条纹块是堆叠的比对记录。上方是内置的 RefSeq 轨道（ ``MTHFR`` 、 ``CLCN6`` ）作为参照。"

#: ../../data-import.rst:104
msgid ""
"Choose the matching assembly: **hg38** for GRCh38 or **sacCer3** for the "
"yeast example below."
msgstr "选择匹配的装配：GRCh38 选择  hg38  ，下方酵母示例选择  sacCer3  。"

#: ../../data-import.rst:106
msgid "Click Import, select the GTF/GFF3, and wait for parsing to finish."
msgstr "点击导入，选择 GTF/GFF3，并等待解析完成。"

#: ../../data-import.rst:107
msgid ""
"Enable its annotation row. Use the dedicated imported-annotation search "
"controls when a gene exists only in your imported file, not in RefSeq."
msgstr "启用其注释行。当基因仅存在于导入文件而不在 RefSeq 中时，请使用专用的导入注释搜索控件。"

#: ../../data-import.rst:109
msgid ""
"Click its small **+** to expand a gene, or the track's gear for **Expand "
"all**. The procedure and a before/after illustration are in "
":doc:`navigation`."
msgstr "点击基因旁的小  +  展开基因，或点击轨道齿轮并选择  全部展开  。具体步骤和前后对比图见  :doc:`navigation`  。"

#: ../../data-import.rst:112
msgid ""
"Imported annotations become a normal gene track: expandable transcripts, "
"strand colours and labels. Chromosome aliases such as ``1`` / ``chr1`` or"
" ``I`` / ``chrI`` are reconciled, but aliases do not convert genome "
"assemblies."
msgstr ""
"导入的注释会成为普通基因轨道：可展开转录本、按链着色并显示标签。 ``1`` / ``chr1`` 或 ``I`` / ``chrI`` "
"等染色体别名会自动对齐，但别名不会转换基因组装配。"

#: ../../data-import.rst:124
msgid ""
"A yeast GTF (``representative_transcripts.gtf``) imported onto sacCer3 "
"and shown directly under the bundled RefSeq track. Gene names and strand "
"arrows are drawn for both."
msgstr ""
"导入到 sacCer3 的酵母 GTF（ ``representative_transcripts.gtf`` ），直接显示在内置 RefSeq "
"轨道下方。两条轨道都会画出基因名与链方向箭头。"

#: ../../data-import.rst:130
msgid ""
"Imported annotations are not converted to the built-in binary format. "
"They are read on load, which is fine for a few hundred thousand features "
"but slower than the bundled RefSeq index."
msgstr "导入的注释不会转成内置二进制格式，而是加载时现读。几十万条特征没问题，但比内置的 RefSeq 索引慢。"

#: ../../data-import.rst:137
msgid ""
"Importing FASTA adds its own sequence track; it does not replace the "
"backend reference for built-in GC, motif or BAM mismatch calculations. "
"Uncompressed FASTA uses indexed file reads. A gzip FASTA is decompressed "
"into memory, so whole-human-genome gzip imports can consume several GB of"
" RAM."
msgstr ""
"导入 FASTA 会添加独立的序列轨道；它不会替代内置 GC、基序或 BAM 错配计算所使用的后端参考。未压缩 FASTA "
"使用索引文件读取。gzip FASTA 会解压到内存，因此导入完整人类基因组的 gzip 文件可能消耗数 GB 内存。"

#: ../../data-import.rst:142
msgid ""
"For the complete human-genome walkthrough, with exact positive/negative-"
"strand start/stop windows, Flip strand and amino-acid translation, see "
":doc:`sequence`."
msgstr "完整的人类基因组操作流程（含正链/负链精确起止窗口、翻转链和氨基酸翻译）见  :doc:`sequence`  。"

#: ../../data-import.rst:145
msgid "Local human FASTA displayed at ACTB with complementary-strand translation"
msgstr "在 ACTB 位点显示本地人类 FASTA 及互补链翻译"

#: ../../data-import.rst:149
msgid ""
"An imported GRCh38 chromosome FASTA at base resolution. The detailed "
"sequence guide explains why a negative-strand gene must be read right to "
"left after flipping the displayed bases."
msgstr "以碱基分辨率显示导入的 GRCh38 染色体 FASTA。详细的序列指南解释了为什么负链基因在翻转显示碱基后必须从右向左读取。"

#: ../../data-import.rst:154
msgid "Where imported tracks live"
msgstr "导入的轨道存在哪"

#: ../../data-import.rst:156
msgid ""
"Importing copies the file into Orbit's per-user data directory "
"(``data/loaded``, or ``%LOCALAPPDATA%/Orbit/loaded`` when the install "
"directory is read-only). The imported copy is used for display; keep your"
" original research files as backups. Remove a track only when you intend "
"to remove its imported copy. Imported tracks are session-scoped by "
"default: set ``IGV_RESTORE_LOADED=1`` to restore them on the next server "
"launch. Restored tracks may still need to be checked on in the sidebar."
msgstr ""
"导入会将文件复制到 Orbit 的用户数据目录（ ``data/loaded`` ；安装目录只读时使用 "
"``%LOCALAPPDATA%/Orbit/loaded`` "
"）。显示时使用导入副本；请将原始研究文件作为备份保留。只有在确实要删除导入副本时才移除轨道。导入轨道默认按会话管理：设置 "
"``IGV_RESTORE_LOADED=1`` 可在下次服务器启动时恢复。恢复的轨道可能仍需在侧栏中手动勾选。"

